         <div type="bio">
            <p>Triestine journalist, librettist, novelist and translator. He met JJ in 1907 and wrote several articles on him and his works for the Italian-language press, including Trieste’s first review of <name type="work" key="W_ULYSSES">Ulysses</name>: “L'Ulisse di James Joyce”, <name type="work" key="ID_MISSING">La Nazione</name> 5, no. 78 (1922): 1. <hi rend="bold">William Brockman</hi>
                </p>
